{
  "secrets": {
    "url": "${fake}/home",
    "username": "automation",
    "secret": "demo-automation-secret"
  },
  "setup": [
    {
      "method": "PATCH",
      "path": "/projects/${project}",
      "body": {
        "name": "Maple Street 12",
        "features": [
          "graph"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/entities",
      "body": {
        "kind": "server",
        "name": "nas-01",
        "slug": "nas-01",
        "attrs": {
          "hostname": "nas-01.home.arpa",
          "ip": "10.20.0.10",
          "os": "TrueNAS"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/entities",
      "body": {
        "kind": "server",
        "name": "pve-01",
        "slug": "pve-01",
        "attrs": {
          "hostname": "pve-01.home.arpa",
          "ip": "10.20.0.11",
          "os": "Proxmox VE"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/entities",
      "body": {
        "kind": "vm",
        "name": "Home Assistant",
        "slug": "home-assistant",
        "attrs": {
          "vmid": 101,
          "os": "Home Assistant OS",
          "ip": "10.20.0.21"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/entities",
      "body": {
        "kind": "router",
        "name": "Router",
        "slug": "router",
        "attrs": {
          "model": "OPNsense",
          "ip": "10.20.0.1"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/plugins/com.phoedox.checkmk/tools/checkmk.problems",
      "body": {},
      "as": "cmk"
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/projects/${project}/documents",
      "body": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "slug": "monitoring-problems",
        "title": "Open monitoring problems",
        "category": "Homelab",
        "markdown": "What an AI client gets from the tool `checkmk.problems` of the Checkmk plugin: the services that are not OK, worst first, each with the Phoedox entry of its host.\n\n| State | Host | Service | Output | Entry |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| ${cmk.0.state} | ${cmk.0.host} | ${cmk.0.service} | ${cmk.0.output} | @${cmk.0.entry.slug} |\n| ${cmk.1.state} | ${cmk.1.host} | ${cmk.1.service} | ${cmk.1.output} | @${cmk.1.entry.slug} |\n| ${cmk.2.state} | ${cmk.2.host} | ${cmk.2.service} | ${cmk.2.output} | @${cmk.2.entry.slug} |\n| ${cmk.3.state} | ${cmk.3.host} | ${cmk.3.service} | ${cmk.3.output} | @${cmk.3.entry.slug} |\n"
      }
    }
  ],
  "shots": [
    {
      "name": "problems",
      "path": "/p/${project}/d/monitoring-problems",
      "caption": "Checkmk problems as AI clients get them, each linked to its entry"
    }
  ]
}
